      },
      {
        "tag": "h2",
        "children": [
          "1. Information We Collect"
        ]
      },
      {
        "tag": "p",
        "children": [
          "Roco itself does not collect personal data by default. However, depending on how you customize and deploy the template, the following types of information ",
          {
            "tag": "strong",
            "children": [
              "may"
            ]
          },
          " be collected:"
        ]
      },
      {
        "tag": "ul",
        "children": [
          {
            "tag": "li",
            "children": [
              {
                "tag": "p",
                "children": [
                  {
                    "tag": "strong",
                    "children": [
                      "Personal Information"
                    ]
                  },
                  {
                    "tag": "br",
                    "children": []
                  },
                  "Such as name, email address, or message content when visitors contact you through a form."
                ]
              }
            ]
          },
          {
            "tag": "li",
            "children": [
              {
                "tag": "p",
                "children": [
                  {
                    "tag": "strong",
                    "children": [
                      "Usage Data"
                    ]
                  },
                  {
                    "tag": "br",
                    "children": []
                  },
                  "Information like pages visited, time spent on the site, device type, and browser, typically collected through analytics tools."
                ]
              }
            ]
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "tag": "h2",
        "children": [
          "2. How Information Is Used"
        ]
      },
      {
        "tag": "p",
        "children": [
          "Any information collected through your website may be used to:"
        ]
      },
      {
        "tag": "ul",
        "children": [
          {
            "tag": "li",
            "children": [
              {
                "tag": "p",
                "children": [
                  "Respond to inquiries or messages"
                ]
              }
            ]
          },
          {
            "tag": "li",
            "children": [
              {
                "tag": "p",
                "children": [
                  "Improve website performance and user experience"
                ]
              }
            ]
          },
          {
            "tag": "li",
            "children": [
              {
                "tag": "p",
                "children": [
                  "Analyze traffic and usage trends"
                ]
              }
            ]
          },
          {
            "tag": "li",
            "children": [
              {
                "tag": "p",
                "children": [
                  "Maintain security and prevent abuse"
                ]
              }
            ]
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "tag": "p",
        "children": [
          "Roco does not sell, trade, or rent personal information to third parties."
        ]
      },
      {
        "tag": "h2",
        "children": [
          "3. Third-Party Services"
        ]
      },
      {
        "tag": "p",
        "children": [
          "You may choose to integrate third-party services such as:"
        ]
      },
      {
        "tag": "ul",
        "children": [
          {
            "tag": "li",
            "children": [
              {
                "tag": "p",
                "children": [
                  "Analytics tools (e.g., Google Analytics)"
                ]
              }
            ]
          },
          {
            "tag": "li",
            "children": [
              {
                "tag": "p",
                "children": [
                  "Contact form providers"
                ]
              }
            ]
          },
          {
            "tag": "li",
            "children": [
              {
                "tag": "p",
                "children": [
                  "Hosting platforms"
