        ]
      },
      {
        "tag": "h2",
        "children": [
          "4. Data Security"
        ]
      },
      {
        "tag": "p",
        "children": [
          "Reasonable measures should be taken to protect user information. However, no method of transmission over the internet or electronic storage is completely secure. Absolute security cannot be guaranteed."
        ]
      },
      {
        "tag": "h2",
        "children": [
          "5. Your Rights"
        ]
      },
      {
        "tag": "p",
        "children": [
          "Depending on your location, visitors may have the right to:"
